      "label": "H0 Core Abstraction Triad",
      "category": "state",
      "summary": "H0 organizes the system around CORPUS, EVIDENCE, and REPRESENTATION as the reusable central layers; other systems configure, transform, store, or interact with this core.",
      "sourceRanges": [
