          "id": "range-f6d5e558-8518-4b7e-a1fc-31b3106e7eb2",
          "originalLines": [
            "## Composition",
            "",
            "Organize the repository around three central abstraction layers:",
            "",
            "1. **Corpus** - authoritative, addressable content.",
            "2. **Evidence** - grounded semantic claims anchored to corpus ranges.",
            "3. **Representation** - navigable visual projections grounded through evidence.",
            "",
            "These layers are the reusable core of the system. Transport, generation agents,",
            "persistence, and UI features exist to configure, transform, store, or interact",
            "with them."
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "REPOSITORY_DIAGRAM_DECOMPOSITION.md",
          "startLine": 158,
          "endLine": 173,
          "symbol": "H0 - Core Abstraction System / Question / Required composition",
          "compactedSource": {
