          "id": "range-ced92aef-e247-47e6-a78e-baa822c9a3d4",
          "originalLines": [
            "## H0 - Core Abstraction System",
            "",
            "### Question",
            "",
            "How do Corpus, Evidence, and Representation form the central abstraction",
            "system, and how do policy, runtime, persistence, and interaction systems",
            "collaborate with them?",
            "",
            "### Required composition",
            "",
            "The diagram should place these three nodes in the center:",
            "",
            "- `CORPUS`",
            "- `EVIDENCE`",
            "- `REPRESENTATION`",
            ""
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
