          "id": "range-97a76ffa-c1a5-49e7-9b03-e41c47807af6",
          "originalLines": [
            "### Corpus",
            "",
            "Corpus is the source of truth. A corpus has an identity, a root, and a provider",
            "capable of listing and reading addressable resources. Current bindings are a",
            "Git worktree and a filesystem document collection.",
            "",
            "Corpus does not know which concepts are important and does not know how they",
            "will be visualized."
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "REPOSITORY_DIAGRAM_DECOMPOSITION.md",
          "startLine": 168,
          "endLine": 176,
          "symbol": "H0 / Required composition",
          "compactedSource": {
