          "id": "range-cf508868-3875-4bc7-9947-d030593cf081",
          "originalLines": [
            "### Evidence",
            "",
            "Evidence is a semantic interpretation grounded in one or more exact corpus",
            "ranges. Today it is persisted as `CodeEntityRecord` and exposed through the",
            "domain-neutral `EvidenceEntity` facade.",
            "",
            "Evidence owns labels, summaries, classifications, anchors, source snapshots,",
            "and optional compacted presentations. A finalized `CodeEntitiesSetRecord` is an",
            "immutable evidence collection for one DiagramSet.",
            "",
            "Evidence does not own ASCII coordinates or workspace layout."
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "REPOSITORY_DIAGRAM_DECOMPOSITION.md",
          "startLine": 168,
          "endLine": 179,
          "symbol": "H0 / Required composition",
