      "handle": "h0-representation",
      "label": "REPRESENTATION",
      "category": "state",
      "summary": "A revisioned visual projection of selected evidence. Mappings connect visual spans to evidence and source ranges, while indexes and graphs organize spatial identities, layers, transitions, recipes, and feedback; grounding always resolves through Evidence.",
      "sourceRanges": [
        {
          "path": "REPOSITORY_DIAGRAM_DECOMPOSITION.md",
