          "id": "range-f48e4200-3eb0-45b8-85e6-573bc9854b9b",
          "originalLines": [
            "### Representation",
            "",
            "Representation is a revisioned projection of selected evidence. Its visible",
            "form is an ASCII Diagram or DiagramComponent. A mapping sidecar connects visual",
            "spans to evidence and exact source ranges. A RepresentationIndex gives those",
            "spans stable spatial identities, while a RepresentationGraph organizes layers,",
            "transitions, recipes, and feedback.",
            "",
            "Representation does not establish truth directly from corpus content. Its",
            "grounding always resolves through Evidence."
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "REPOSITORY_DIAGRAM_DECOMPOSITION.md",
