          "originalLines": [
            "## External collaborators",
            "",
            "H0 should link four systems outside the central abstraction triangle.",
            "",
            "### Policy and recipes",
            "",
            "`DomainProfile`, `EvidenceSchema`, content presentation, command contributions,",
            "and representation recipes configure how the core abstractions behave.",
            "",
            "Policy chooses the corpus kind and evidence vocabulary. It also controls which",
            "workspace surfaces, renderers, and element commands are available. Recipe",
            "records guide representation layers and revisions.",
            "",
            "This is a configuration plane, not a fourth data layer.",
            "",
            "Primary source anchors:",
            "",
            "- `src/domainProfile.ts`",
            "- `src/domainProfiles.ts`",
            "- `server/domainProfiles.ts`",
            "- `src/representationGraph.ts` recipe records",
            "- `src/prompt.ts` template and prompt bindings"
          ]
