            "### Workspace and API",
            "",
            "The interaction plane lets callers select evidence, generate or revise a",
            "representation, inspect mappings, reveal corpus content, add feedback, and save",
            "highlights. The UI is a consumer and controller of the core model; it is not",
            "the model itself.",
            "",
            "Primary source anchors:",
            "",
            "- `server/http.ts`",
            "- `src/api.ts`",
            "- `src/App.tsx`",
            "- `src/components/DiagramView.tsx`",
            "- `src/components/CodeEntitiesPanel.tsx`",
            "- `src/components/RepresentationLayersPanel.tsx`",
            "",
            "An external user or CLI may connect to Workspace and API, but user-interface",
            "details should remain outside H0."
